portal-server
Copyright 2026 MonkFish IoT

portal-server is a standalone PORTAL page server for the MonkFish cloud
platform. It receives the webauthd 302 redirect proxied by the AP-side
nginx, selects a portal template by device ID or query parameter, and
returns the portal login page.

